  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.89` to `4.1.90`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.89...application_builder_helpers/4.1.90)\n\n## What's Changed\n* deps: update all NuGet packages across entire repo by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/312\n* fix: resolve ApplicationBuilderHelpers version mismatch in WebApiAndWebApp template by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/314\n* fix: exclude ApplicationBuilderHelpers from Dependabot in all templates by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/315\n* Bump Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk from 18.6.0 to 18.7.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/316\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20260617103044.5ac0b2d...build.20260623103030.fd16339",
